# Secrets. These carry the production database password and the EVE SSO client
# secret, so the rule is deny-by-default with a single explicit exception for
# the committed template. The parent monorepo has an equivalent rule, but this
# is a separate repository and cannot rely on it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Compiled binaries (plus the `ek` symlink).
bin/

# Local docker-compose state (postgres, valkey, memgraph). Reproducible from
# `docker compose up` plus the SDE importer, so it is never committed.
.data/

# Embedded Caddy state, including the private key for the local development CA.
/data/

# Local notes, rollout runbooks (including the deferred Cloudflare image
# Snippet), and handoff logs kept at the repository root. Tracked Markdown such
# as README.md remains tracked; Markdown in subdirectories is unaffected.
/*.md
!CLAUDE.md

# Local product-research issues and implementation notes. These are kept as a
# working backlog without turning unfinished ideas into repository policy.
/issues/

# Editor state. The directory currently holds only machine-local runtime files
# such as .server-controller-port.log, which name a port valid for one session
# on one machine. Re-include a specific file with `!` if a setting ever needs
# to be shared.
.vscode/
